  "description": "<h4 data-end=\"82\" data-start=\"52\"><strong data-end=\"80\" data-start=\"57\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"83\">Mony Beauty is the only provider of ethically sourced&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"169\" data-start=\"140\">raw curly hair extensions</strong>&nbsp;in the&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"209\" data-start=\"177\">Middle East and North Africa</strong>. As the only brand in the region offering&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"288\" data-start=\"252\">100% raw, unprocessed curly hair</strong>, we cater to textured-haired women who value authenticity, longevity, and luxury in their hair extensions.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"414\" data-start=\"383\"><strong data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"388\">Product Description:</strong></h4>\r\n<p data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"415\">Our extensions are made from&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"475\" data-start=\"444\">pure, single-donor raw hair</strong>&nbsp;that maintains its natural curl pattern, ensuring unmatched&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"576\" data-start=\"536\">quality, durability, and versatility</strong>. Unlike processed or steam-permed hair, our raw curly hair blends seamlessly with natural curls and lasts 4<strong data-end=\"712\" data-start=\"683\">+ years with proper care</strong>.</p>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"717\"><strong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"722\">Unique Selling Point (USP):</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"756\">\r\n<li data-end=\"834\" data-start=\"756\"><strong data-end=\"773\" data-start=\"758\">Exclusivity</strong>: The&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"787\" data-start=\"779\">only</strong>&nbsp;provider of&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"800\">100% raw curly hair</strong>&nbsp;in MENA.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"936\" data-start=\"835\"><strong data-end=\"856\" data-start=\"837\">Premium Quality</strong>: No chemical processing, no artificial curls&mdash;just pure,&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"913\">untouched beauty</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"937\"><strong data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"939\">Ethical Sourcing</strong>: Our hair is collected&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"998\" data-start=\"983\">responsibly</strong>&nbsp;and supports fair trade practices.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1146\" data-start=\"1036\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1038\">Long-Lasting Investment</strong>: Our extensions last&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1096\" data-start=\"1087\">years</strong>, unlike synthetic or factory-made alternatives.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1188\" data-start=\"1148\"><strong data-end=\"1186\" data-start=\"1153\">Payment Terms for Affiliates:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1189\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1189\"><strong data-end=\"1211\" data-start=\"1191\">Commission-Based</strong>: Earn a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1243\" data-start=\"1220\">percentage per sale</strong>&nbsp;(e.g., 5-10% commission) based on referrals.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1292\"><strong data-end=\"1313\" data-start=\"1294\">Payout Schedule</strong>: Payments are made&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1344\" data-start=\"1333\">monthly</strong>&nbsp;via&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1349\">bank transfer.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1395\"><strong data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1397\">Tracking System</strong>: Each affiliate gets a&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1440\">unique link &amp; dashboard</strong>&nbsp;to track sales and commissions.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4 data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1503\"><strong data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1508\">Other Information:</strong></h4>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1885\" data-start=\"1533\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1533\"><strong data-end=\"1556\" data-start=\"1535\">Marketing Support</strong>: Affiliates get exclusive&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"1601\" data-start=\"1583\">discount codes</strong>, branded content, and promotional materials to help them sell.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1788\" data-start=\"1667\"><strong data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1669\">Ideal Affiliates</strong>: Influencers, hairstylists, beauty bloggers, and salon owners who cater to curly-haired clients.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1885\" data-start=\"1789\"><strong data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1791\">Easy Sign-Up</strong>: A simple application process with approval based on audience &amp; engagement.</li>\r\n</ul>",
